sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Alice
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant EX as expense-service
  participant AC as account-service
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant SE as settlement-service
  participant NO as notification-service
  A->>GW: POST /api/expenses {groupId, 60€, EQUAL} (JWT)
  GW->>EX: route lb://EXPENSE-SERVICE
  EX->>AC: GET /api/groups/{id}/members (OpenFeign, sync)
  alt account-service disponible
    AC-->>EX: 200 [Alice, Bob, Chloé]
    EX->>EX: calcule 3 parts de 20€ (BigDecimal) + enregistre
    EX-->>A: 201 Created
    EX--)MQ: publie expense.created
    MQ--)SE: consomme → crée 2 dettes (Bob→Alice, Chloé→Alice)
    SE--)MQ: publie debt.created ×2
    MQ--)NO: consomme → "Tu dois 20 € à Alice"
  else account-service indisponible
    EX-->>A: 503 (circuit breaker, rien n'est enregistré)
  end
